  "description": "<div class=\"c-details__content-inner\">This legendary classic bottle is built to withstand anything- dents and drops included. Regardless of how often this bottle is thrown into your bag or the back of your car, the thermal integrity of your beverage will be maintained for up to 38 hours. It’s slim enough to grip with one hand and leakproof with the aid of a twist-and-pour stopper for better serving control. The lid is insulated and doubles as a cup. The recycled stainless steel vacuum bottle is designed with easy cleaning in mind and is entirely dishwasher-safe.</div>\n<ul class=\"c-details__list\">\n<li>Recycled 18/8 stainless steel, BPA-free</li>\n<li>Double-wall vacuum insulation</li>\n<li>Leakproof + packable</li>\n<li>Insulated lid doubles as cup</li>\n<li>Dishwasher safe</li>\n</ul>\n<div><br></div>\n<div class=\"c-details__specs\">\n<div class=\"c-details__spec\">\n<h3 class=\"c-details__label\">Weight:</h3>\n<div class=\"c-details__detail\">910g</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"c-details__spec\">\n<h3 class=\"c-details__label\">Dimensions:</h3>\n<div class=\"c-details__detail\">119 x 99 x 358 mm</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
